      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sounds weird and complicated.\nIf you set it to 2 and the instance only has the master at the moment no one can join?!\nBut I feel where you are going, maybe instead this can be restricted by degrees of separation:\n1 - must be direct friend\n2 - friends of friends can get in too\n3 - friends of friends of friends\netc..\nmax - anyone",
